<header><p class="st-kicker">republic · Central and Southern Africa</p><h1 class="st-title">Goshen</h1><p class="st-meta">1882 CE – 1885 CE · capital Rooigrond</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A tiny Boer freebooter republic on the Tswana border, whose land grab provoked Britain to take over southern Bechuanaland.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>In 1882 white volunteers who had fought for the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/barolong">Barolong</a> chief Moshette against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/montshiwa">Montshiwa</a> were rewarded with farms, and they proclaimed the Land Goshen with its headquarters at Rooigrond, near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mahikeng">Mafikeng</a>. Its administrator was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gey-van-pittius">Gey van Pittius</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Goshen had little more than a few hundred settlers, raiding <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/montshiwa">Montshiwa's</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cattle">cattle</a> and land. It sought union with the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/south-african-republic">South African Republic</a>, which proclaimed a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protectorate">protectorate</a> in 1884; <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/united-kingdom">Britain</a> objected because the territory lay on the 'missionaries' road' to the interior.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/warren-expedition">Warren Expedition</a> of 1884-1885 dispersed the freebooters without a fight, and the land was incorporated into <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/british-bechuanaland">British Bechuanaland</a> in 1885. The affair helped secure <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain's</a> route to the north, later used by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cecil-rhodes">Cecil Rhodes</a>.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="republic, 1882 CE – 1885 CE"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 38 L50 20 L80 38 Z"/><path d="M24 42 H76 M24 80 H76"/><path d="M30 44 V78 M43 44 V78 M57 44 V78 M70 44 V78"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">republic</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Central and Southern Africa</p>